vv vendors md4c — Martin Mitáš's CommonMark + GFM parser — to render
.md files in the terminal. We keep only the SAX parser:
  md4c.c, md4c.h        — the parser itself
  entity.c, entity.h    — HTML entity decoding (&amp; etc.)

The HTML renderer (md4c-html.c / .h) is *not* vendored — vv drives
the SAX callbacks itself to emit ANSI / ncurses output. The CLI tool
(md2html.c) is likewise dropped.

To bump the pinned version: replace the files above from the new tag
and update this UPSTREAM file.
